19 | impl Series($U) for Plain {
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
20 |     count :: (self: *Plain) -> i64 { self.n }
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
21 | }
   | ^

error: 'impl Series' names a generic carrier but no binder among its type arguments
  --> examples/diagnostics/2029-diagnostics-blanket-impl-refusals.sx:24:1
   |
24 | impl Series(i64) for Buffer($T) {
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
25 |     count :: (self: *Buffer) -> i64 { 1 }
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
26 | }
   | ^

help: spell the carrier's binder in the type arguments too ('impl Series($T) for …($T)'), or give the carrier a concrete instantiation
   |
